[CHANGELOG V4.1.1] 

✅ Added an option to disable voice chat
✅ Enabled painting via screen touch
✅ Added a mic status icon to the top of the screen when in use
🔧 Fixed an issue where switching spectate targets with LT wasn't working
🔧 Fixed an issue where pressing the refresh button in the User Management tab caused the UI to freeze
🔧 Fixed an issue where certain maps were loaded by default
🔧 Adjusted the A/B/X/Y button prompt displays for Switch 2
🔧 Changed incoming voice chat audio to muted by default
🔧 Fixed an issue where joining with many players at once bypassed the maximum player limit
🔧 Fixed an issue where changing brush size with the analog stick caused it to snap back to its original position
🔧 Temporarily reduced the maximum host player limit on Switch 2 from 12 to 10
(Note: We are currently investigating the ongoing crash issues)
🔧 Fixed an issue where switching to mouse controls at the start of Paint Mode moved the cursor to an unintended position
🔧 Fixed an issue where the cursor experienced heavy drift/pull after specific actions